# --- ai assistants / editors ------------------------------------------------
# CLAUDE.md is the contributor guide and belongs in the repository: it carries
# the rules a change has to respect, and a rule nobody can read is a rule that
# gets broken. Shared skills too. The rest of .claude/ is one developer's own
# settings and stays out.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
AGENTS.md
AGENT.md
.cursor/
.cursorrules
.aider*
.github/copilot-instructions.md

.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
